msgstr ""

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:73
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/role
msgid "The swimlane: a persona an actor takes on because of the lane it is acting in, carrying the skills that lane's activities need."
msgstr "泳道：行动者因其所在泳道而担任的角色形象，承载该泳道中各活动所需的技能。"

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:126
#. Glossary term label: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/todo
msgid "todo"
msgstr ""

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:88
#. Glossary term label: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/user-story
msgid "user story"
msgstr ""

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:105
#. Glossary term label: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/voice
msgid "voice"
msgstr ""

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:88
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/user-story
msgid "What a reader acting in a Role is trying to do, told as that role: as a <role>, I want <want>, so that <so that>. The story points at its role; the role names no story."
msgstr ""

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/folio-assistant-core.glossary.json:30
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/platform/policy
msgid "Which Actor may do which action, and where, written as W3C ODRL 2.2 permission and prohibition rules scoped by Process, Task and Role."
msgstr "哪个行动者可以在何处执行哪项操作，以按流程、任务和角色限定范围的 W3C ODRL 2.2 许可与禁止规则表述。"
